  {
    "episode_id": 75272,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75272.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Excellent. And so there's definitely a lot of work to be done. So your office went and examined everything again. And of course, as you said, they hadn't done that due diligence. So we got to keep pushing. We got to keep fighting, right? And what are some of those things that we can continue to do? You know, why is the 911 SAVES Act still important?",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_03",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
