        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Due diligence was expected but failed to occur, indicating negligence or oversight.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The importance of the 911 SAVES Act has not been adequately recognized or acted upon yet.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Public pressure and advocacy are effective mechanisms for driving policy change.",
        "confidence": 0.87
