    "turn_text": "Right. We, you know, there's always been money in the police budgets that, you know, they could number one or PSAP centers could apply for. But we know that that has not been a priority, because that money is quickly absorbed, you know, to train. the police officers or the paramedics. So in this bill, we actually call out that there, you know, there has to be, there's this money specifically for these positions. So the bill includes 8 million in the Highway Trust funds for EMS and 911. And up to 5 million is available under the behavior safety program. DOT still needs to create the parameters and send out a notice that this funding is available. But that is why I am asking you to give us some information as to who to contact, who to send this information to at your PSAP. So as soon as it comes out, as soon as my office is noticed, we can send you this information.",
