    "turn_text": "How do you see, actually, where do you see? You kind of mentioned it, you know, how in the future, you know, it could be completely different. We already went through the text 9-1-1. It wasn't as consuming as people thought it was going to be, you know? but now we've also got video to 911 and such that there's centers out there that are using and there's not only the training for that but also what comes with it with the mental health and wellness of those who are actually seeing what is going on but there are also others who feel that You know, being able to see certain things might actually help with closure. So for you, though, kind of thinking about the future of 911, like, where do you kind of see that going? Like, are we going to have almost like VR headsets, you know, being able",
